{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#card-zh","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Probe 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的插件页面验收工具，通过宿主工具和页面端桥接，在真实运行界面中检查插件页面。它可以打开目标面板或在当前页面检查，读取元素尺寸、位置、文字和计算样式，按文字或 CSS 选择器查找并点击控件、填写输入框与富文本、等待异步变化、查看页面快照和控制台错误。验收步骤会形成时间线，并在结束或空闲超时后返回原对话；设置页还可检查版本、更新或卸载插件。适合开发者核对插件界面行为；安装后无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:524","client.js:104","client.js:551"]}
{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#card-en","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH UI Probe checks plugin pages in the running DSH web app. It reads layout and styles, clicks controls, fills fields, waits for changes, and captures snapshots and console errors. Sessions return a timeline and restore the conversation; settings can check for and install updates.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:524","client.js:104","client.js:551"]}
