{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#feature-1","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Probe 的功能「界面检查」：可按可见文字或 CSS 选择器定位页面元素，并返回其尺寸、位置、文字、属性和计算样式。可用 audit 检查单个目标，也可用快照查看可见标题与按钮。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:524","client.js:104"]}
{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#feature-2","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Probe 的功能「页面交互」：在验收步骤中点击控件、向输入框或富文本填写内容、发送键盘按键，并将输入值读回核对。每一步的结果会加入会话时间线。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:554","client.js:645"]}
{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#feature-3","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Probe 的功能「异步观察」：可轮询等待目标元素出现，或等待指定时长后读取页面快照，便于核对点击之后才出现的异步界面变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:554","client.js:630"]}
{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#feature-4","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Probe 的功能「会话收尾」：开始验收时记录来源对话，结束时返回步骤时间线、页面快照和近期错误，并尝试回到来源对话；空闲 30 秒也会自动结束。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:524","client.js:551"]}
{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#caveat-1","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Probe 的使用须知：版本检查会连接 api.github.com 读取仓库提交与 package.json 版本信息；更新操作通过 DSH 插件管理器安装该仓库。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:262","index.js:280","index.js:308"]}
{"unit_id":"yuexizhishang__dsh-ui-probe#caveat-2","repo":"yuexizhishang/dsh-ui-probe","commit":"1505def381fc7fb94d2c2de99b2f1ff64bd98b03","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Probe 的使用须知：界面验收通过本机 DSH 同源路由在宿主与网页端之间传递检查动作和结果，并在浏览器 sessionStorage 暂存会话来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:28","client.js:495","client.js:847"]}
